              "code": "<h2 align=\"center\">Comfort and Convenience: Redefine Shopping Online <br>for Bras and Panties with Celessa, Malaysia</h2>\n<p align=\"center\">It is in our core belief that the confidence we exude externally begins from what we feel internally, ie; the first layer we put onto our skin. Having said that, Celessa has made it our responsibility to cater to the needs of our Malaysian women with high-quality products that give them the feel of luxury and class as they experience a smooth online shopping experience for their seamless panties and <a href=\"https://celessa.com.my/collections/seamless-series/products/copy-of-airy-seamless-lingerie-set\">wireless bra in Malaysia.</a></p>\n<p align=\"center\">Time to indulge and self pamper with unparalleled quality and style for your day to day and also occasions with Celessa as your go-to <a href=\"https://celessa.com.my/\">lingerie brand in Malaysia.</a> Embark on your sense of sophistication matched with cosiness let it be for when you shop for range of seamless panties that keep your cheeks tucked in shapely or when you want to uplift your bosom naturally when you get your <a href=\"https://celessa.com.my/products/curvy-boost-push-up-seamless-strapless-bra?_pos=1&_sid=4dafcb40e&_ss=r\">online shopping done for push up bras in Malaysia.</a> </p>"
            }
          },
