              "title": "",
              "text": "<h1>Empowering Elegance through Premium Lingerie Online Shopping in Malaysia</h1><p>Founded in 2018, Celessa’s, a brand of online lingerie shop in Malaysia has become a favourite platform for many women. In the current era,  there are many seeking convenience merged with comfort when they shop online for bras and panties in Malaysia, thus the birth of Celessa has become their one-stop solution. </p><p>When you think Celessa, comfort is what we intend to pop into your mind. Originating from the combination of the words <strong>C</strong>omfort and S<strong>elesa </strong>with an additional <strong>s, </strong>it is our brand's utmost purpose to provide style without compromising comfort throughout womens’ day when they shop for their bra and panties online in Malaysia. </p>",
