              "code": "<div id=\"content-wrapper\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"read-more-state\" id=\"post-3\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:strong; margin-top:05px; margin-bottom:5px; \">\nIndulge in Comfort: Discover Your Perfect Bra Fit with Best Online Lingerie Brand in Malaysia\n</h1>\n<p class=\"read-more-wrap\">\nAt Celessa, comfort meets style with our diverse collection of innerwear and sleepwear designed to cater to women of all sizes and backgrounds.\n</p>\n<!-- Button placed here -->\n<label for=\"post-3\" class=\"read-more-trigger\"></label>\n<p class=\"read-more-wrap\">\n<span class=\"read-more-target\">\nFrom petite to plus-size and even expectant mothers, we offer an extensive range that embraces every body type and stage of life, promising inclusivity for women of all walks of life for <a href=\"https://celessa.com.my/products/bare-seamless-bra-1\">seamless bras in Malaysia</a> along with our other products online. Experience the luxury of <a href=\"https://celessa.com.my/collections/seamless-brief/products/bare-seamless-hygiene-panties\">seamless underwear in Malaysia</a> that not only conceals lines but also accentuates your natural curves effortlessly. Our carefully crafted pieces are tailored to provide a snug fit without compromising on comfort, ensuring you feel confident and at ease throughout the day or night.\nPerfect for various styling needs, as one of the best online bra brands in Malaysia, our high-quality products allow you to explore different looks with ease. Whether it's a casual day out or a special occasion, our collection guarantees a seamless blend of quality, comfort, and style.\n</span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"read-more-wrap\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:strong; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:5px\">\n<span class=\"read-more-target\">\nEffortless Elegance Delivered to Your Doorstep from Malaysia’s Online Lingerie Brand\n</span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"read-more-wrap\">\n<span class=\"read-more-target\">\nBrowse